cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "egfr-batch: batch-compute CKD-EPI 2021 eGFR from a CSV, with explicitly declared units"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/egfr-batch"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/egfr-batch"
abstract: >-
  Batch-computes eGFR with the published CKD-EPI 2021 equations
  (creatinine and creatinine-cystatin C) from a CSV of age, sex and
  creatinine, with the creatinine unit declared explicitly; optionally
  adds Cockcroft-Gault creatinine clearance and de-indexed eGFR.
  Research and educational tool only. Not a medical device: published-
  formula arithmetic only, no diagnosis, staging or interpretation.
keywords:
  - eGFR
  - CKD-EPI 2021
  - creatinine
  - clinical research
